  ],
  "explanation": "Post small non-crossing two-sided quotes: bid 1004 improves the best bid inside the 1003/1005 spread, ask 1005 joins the best ask. Different prices avoid any self-trade. Inventory is 0, well within the 30-lot limit."
}
```

